(MCA Department - Master of Computer Applications) '
(Course: Advanced Software Engineering \(Unit 4: Quality & Process Models\)) '
() '
(Topic: Capability Maturity Model Integration \(CMMI\)) '
() '
(Overview:) '
(CMMI is a process level improvement training and appraisal program developed by Carnegie Mellon University.) '
(It provides organizations with the essential elements of effective processes that ultimately improve their performance.) '
(CMMI models provide guidance for developing or improving processes that meet the business goals of an organization.) '
ET
endstream
