(Differences between CMMI Staged vs Continuous Representations:) '
() '
(1. Staged Representation:) '
(- Uses predefined sets of process areas to define an improvement path characterized by 5 maturity levels.) '
(- Provides a proven sequence of improvements, each serving as a foundation for the next.) '
() '
(2. Continuous Representation:) '
(- Enables an organization to select a specific process area and improve processes related to it.) '
(- Uses 4 capability levels \(Incomplete, Performed, Managed, Defined\) to measure individual process improvements.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
